==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Emerald|Voltorb|71}} from the {{TCG|EX Emerald}} expansion.
*'''Lightning Ball''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Lanturn|20}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

